{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A run saved inside Sub, kept in a .plang file (signed by this app) and read back, goes on from its save in an app of its\nown: Sub's next step reads the context's %name% and its frame's %city%, Record goes on after the call, and the step\nbefore the save doesn't run again (%count% comes back 1: it is set here, before the call, so a Sub or Record run twice\nwould count on to 2). The resumed run goes on through this goal too, from the step after `call Record`: the marker,\nwritten after the save and never in the snapshot, sends it to Resumed, which writes what it saw and ends it. The\nasker's own variables are untouched by the resumed run.",
